flowchart TD
  KEY[Keyboard input] --> OWNER[InteractiveUi input owner]
  OWNER --> FOCUS{Focused dialog?}
  FOCUS -->|Yes| MODAL[Selector, approval, or detail view]
  FOCUS -->|No| EDITOR[Prompt editor and commands]
  EDITOR --> LOOP[Agent loop]
  LOOP --> EVENTS[Normalized runtime events]
  EVENTS --> STORE[UiStore display blocks]
  STORE --> COMPONENTS[Transcript, activity, and footer]
  MODAL --> RENDER[pi differential renderer]
  COMPONENTS --> RENDER
  RENDER --> SCREEN[Terminal screen cells]
  LOOP --> JOURNAL[Independent conversation journal]
